\v 2 who¦155358 \add then\add* \add faithfully\add* passed on everything he¦155371 saw¦155371 \nd of¦155363 God's¦155363\nd* message¦155361 and¦155364 the¦155365 testimony¦155366 \nd of¦155367 Yeshua¦155367 the¦155368 messiah¦155368\nd*.
\v 3 \add God will\add* bless¦155372 anyone who reads¦155374 or listens¦155377 to the¦155378 messages¦155380 of¦155383 this prophecy¦155384 and¦155385 obeys what's written¦155390 in¦155388 it¦155389, because¦155392 the time¦155393 \add of these events happening\add* is¦155393 close¦155394.
