\v 9 I¦155557, Yohan¦155558, am¦155587 your¦155562 brother¦155561 and¦155563 partner in¦155566 the¦155567 suffering \add that's typical of those who follow\add* \nd Yeshua¦155577\nd*. \add I've been exiled to\add* Patmos¦155588 Island¦155585 where I endure¦155574 because¦155589 I believe \nd God's¦155594\nd* message¦155592 and¦155595 \nd Yeshua's¦155599\nd* testimony¦155598 and \add look forward to\add* \add &his\add* kingdom¦155572.
\v 10 One Sunday \add while I was meditating\add*, \add &God's¦155604\add* \nd spirit¦155604\nd* gave me a vision, and¦155609 I¦155610 heard¦155610 a¦155614 voice¦155614 behind¦155612 me¦155613 that seemed as loud¦155615 as¦155618 a¦155619 trumpet¦155619 blast
\v 11 that said¦155620, “Write¦155637 down what¦155634 you¦155635 see¦155635 \add here\add* on a¦155640 scroll¦155640 and¦155641 send¦155642 it to¦155643 the¦155643 seven¦155644 assemblies¦155645 \add of believers\add*—to¦155649 \add the cities of\add* Ephesus¦155650, Smyrna¦155653, Pergamum, Thyatira¦155659, Sardis¦155666, Philadelphia¦155669, and¦155670 to¦155671 Laodicea¦155672.”
\p
\v 12 Then¦155673 I¦155675 turned¦155675 to¦155676 see¦155676 who was¦155680 talking¦155680 to me¦155684, and¦155685 I¦155687 saw¦155687 seven¦155688 golden¦155690 lamp holders,
\v 13 and¦155691 standing among¦155693 them was a man¦155702 who looked like¦155699 the¦155695 son¦155700 of¦155702 humanity¦155702,\f + \fr 1:13 \ft It's not certain what was meant here: either ‘a man who looked like the son of humanity’ or ‘a form that looked like a human man’.\f*\x + \xo 1:13: \xt Dan 7:13.\x* wearing a long robe with a golden¦155711 sash around¦155706 \add &His¦155708\add* chest¦155709.\x + \xo 1:13: \xt Dan 10:5.\x*
\v 14 His¦155718 \add #hair¦155719\add* was¦155719 gleaming white¦155720 like¦155722 wool¦155723 or snow¦155726\x + \xo 1:14: \xt Dan 7:9.\x* and¦155727 his eyes¦155729 were \add bright\add* like¦155731 a¦155732 fiery flame¦155732.
\v 15 His feet¦155736 shone like¦155738 bronze¦155739 that had¦155743 been¦155743 refined¦155743 in¦155741 a¦155742 furnace¦155742, and¦155746 his voice¦155748 was like¦155750 the¦155751 sound¦155751 of¦155752 a \add river of rushing\add* \add #water¦155752\add*.\x + \xo 1:15: \xt Eze 1:24; 43:2.\x*
\v 16 He was holding¦155755 seven¦155764 stars¦155763 in¦155757 his right¦155759 hand¦155761 and¦155765 a¦155770 sharp¦155772 sword¦155770 was extending from his mouth¦155768, and¦155774 his face¦155776 was like¦155779 the¦155780 sun¦155781 shining¦155782 at its¦155786 brightest.
\v 17 And¦155787 when¦155788 I¦155789 saw¦155789 him¦155790, I¦155791 quickly lay at¦155793 his feet¦155795, \add breathless\add* like¦155797 a dead¦155799 \add >man\add*, but¦155800 he¦155801 placed¦155801 his right¦155804 hand¦155804 on¦155807 me¦155808, and told¦155809 me, “Don't¦155811 be¦155812 afraid¦155812. \em I¦155813 am¦155814\em* the¦155815 first¦155817 and¦155818 the¦155819 last¦155820.\x + \xo 1:17: \xt Isa 44:6; 48:12; Rev 2:8; 22:13.\x*
