\v 9 “I¦156108 know¦156108 about your¦156109 suffering and¦156115 your poverty¦156117, but¦156118 you're¦156121 \add actually\add* rich¦156119! I also¦156122 know how about the¦156123 slander¦156124 of¦156126 those who consider themselves¦156132 to¦156131 be¦156131 Jews, but¦156133 they're¦156135 not¦156134 \add true\add* Jews because \add ≈their master is¦156136\add* Satan¦156139.
\v 10 Don't¦156140 be¦156142 afraid¦156142 about what¦156143 you're¦156144 going¦156144 to¦156146 suffer¦156146. Yes, the¦156152 devil¦156153 will throw¦156150 some¦156150 of¦156154 you¦156155 into¦156158 prison¦156159 where your \add faith\add* will be¦156161 tested¦156161, and¦156162 you'll¦156163 experience persecution for ten¦156168 days¦156167. \add Just\add* remain faithful¦156170, even if it means death¦156172, and¦156173 I'll¦156174 give¦156174 you¦156175 life¦156179 as a reward.
