\v 11 Everyone who wants to understand needs¦156183 to listen¦156183 to what¦156184 \add &God's¦156185\add* \nd spirit¦156186\nd* is¦156187 saying¦156187 to¦156188 the¦156188 assemblies¦156189.
\p Anyone who \add stays true\add* won't¦156193 be¦156194 affected by¦156195 the¦156198 second¦156199 death¦156197.”\x + \xo 2:11: \xt Rev 20:14; 21:8.\x*
