\v 24 But¦156540 the¦156543 rest¦156545 of you \add believers in the city\add* of Thyatira¦156548 haven't obeyed that¦156546 woman's \add #teachings\add* and haven't \add ≈taken part\add* in¦156547 what she calls ‘the¦156552 secret practices that¦156556 Satan¦156563 taught her’, I have something to say to you all as well. I won't give you any other burden¦156572
\v 25 except just to continue to obey the true teaching that¦156579 you've¦156575 received, until¦156578 I¦156581 return¦156581.
\v 26 And anyone who's victorious, who continues to do what I command until¦156588 the¦156589 end¦156589, I'll¦156593 give¦156593 them authority¦156595 to rule over¦156596 the¦156597 people groups on earth.
\v 27 They'll rule them¦156601 with¦156602 \add ≈irresistible power\add*, and¦156599 \add those who rebel\add* will¦156600 be¦156600 smashed¦156610 like¦156605 \add unwanted\add* clay pots,\x + \xo 2:26-27: \xt Psa 2:8-9 (LXX).\x*
\v 28 just like¦156613 \add the authority\add* that I've¦156614 received¦156615 from¦156616 my¦156619 father¦156618. And¦156620 I'll¦156621 give¦156621 them the¦156625 morning¦156626 star¦156624.
\p
\v 29 Everyone who wants to understand needs¦156630 to listen¦156630 to what¦156631 \add &God's¦156632\add* \nd spirit¦156633\nd* is¦156634 saying¦156634 to¦156635 the¦156635 assemblies¦156636.”
\c 3
